  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Press Ctrl to run (drains stamina)\r\n\r\n2. Press I to open/close
    inventory. Hover over items to show equip/drop buttons.\r\n\r\n3. Press E to
    open/close keypad, use gates/stairs, interact with interactables.\r\n\r\n4. Weapon
    upgrade bench activates on proximity by pressing E. Press Esc to exit upgrade
    UI.\r\n\r\n5. Hold Space to apply upgrades to weapons in the upgrade UI.\n\n6.
    Click on weapon tabs in weapon upgrade UI to switch between weapons. Use up/down
    arrow keys to select which upgrade to do.\r\n\r\n7. Drag and drop raw materials
    onto each other in your inventory to craft.\n   \n   Crafting Recipes:\r\n  
    Molotov = Alcohol + Rags\r\n   Bandage = Alcohol + Rags\r\n   Makeshift Knife
    = Metal Scrap + Rags\r\n   \n8. Press Esc to exit from interactables.\n\n9. Interactables
    have a hovering yellow marker on them.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
